[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8760.309, "timestamp": "02:26:00", "text": "。问题是，呃，你觉得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8762.309, "timestamp": "02:26:02", "text": "你能杀了我吗？实际上，你的瞄准"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8764.309, "timestamp": "02:26:04", "text": "真的很好。我注意到，即使在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8767.91, "timestamp": "02:26:07", "text": "我们玩的时候，呃，上次。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8769.55, "timestamp": "02:26:09", "text": "呃，不是上次。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8773.83, "timestamp": "02:26:13", "text": "嗯，在此之前我们玩的时候，你知道，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8775.67, "timestamp": "02:26:15", "text": "呃，你的瞄准真的很好。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8777.51, "timestamp": "02:26:17", "text": "总是想，“哇，Jocknix的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8780.87, "timestamp": "02:26:20", "text": "瞄准太酷了。”所以你很擅长瞄准，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8782.79, "timestamp": "02:26:22", "text": "而这款游戏的核心就是瞄准，所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8785.11, "timestamp": "02:26:25", "text": "你知道，谁知道呢？是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8789.11, "timestamp": "02:26:29", "text": "11000 DPI的瞄准。这很痛苦。没错。没错"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8791.91, "timestamp": "02:26:31", "text": "。等等，你用什么DVR"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8794.07, "timestamp": "02:26:34", "text": "玩游戏？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8797.67, "timestamp": "02:26:37", "text": "呃，问得好。我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8799.83, "timestamp": "02:26:39", "text": "我从来没看过。我从来没 查过了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8801.59, "timestamp": "02:26:41", "text": "你以前是不是经常练瞄准"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8806.07, "timestamp": "02:26:46", "text": "？我以前练过，那时候还没流行瞄准"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8808.95, "timestamp": "02:26:48", "text": "功能。在 Aimlabs 发布之前"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8812.71, "timestamp": "02:26:52", "text": "，我用 Kovax 之类的软件练"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8815.59, "timestamp": "02:26:55", "text": "Fortnite 之类的游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8818.23, "timestamp": "02:26:58", "text": "哦，你当时就像个想成为职业"}]